Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 15:36:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] SystemUI: Open Dual Shade panels above a bottom tray

With persist.retro.panel_anchor=bottom_end the floating notification and
quick settings panels anchor to the bottom of the screen, above a taskbar
tray, and swiping down on them closes them. Launcher3 can toggle either
panel on a given display, so the panel opens on the display whose tray
was tapped.
